Released under Apache 2.0 license as described in the file LICENSE.
Authors: The Tau Ceti contributors

Adapted to arbitrary descending multiplicative filtrations for PaperVerification.
Exact upstream source: TauCeti revision 06d5bb4e3ebb737dc6538567f5c53bf8800b9362,
TauCeti/Algebra/WordFiltration/AssociatedGraded.lean.  The quotient product,
unit, associativity, direct-sum ring and algebra proofs are retained; the
word-specific generator induction is omitted. The descending version uses the
actual quotients F_k/F_(k+1) and their induced product. This source is UNCOMPILED.
